# GPS Dashboard - SharePoint Configuration
# This file configures the GPS Dashboard for multi-user SharePoint storage
# 
# For local-only storage (no SharePoint), leave both settings empty or comment them out
# For SharePoint multi-user storage, fill in both settings below

# Path to the shared SharePoint folder (synced to OneDrive)
# This is the ROOT folder path, with no subfolder
# Use SINGLE quotes around the path
GPS_STATE_DIR=''

# Your username for this setup
# Used to create your personal subfolder in the shared location
# Letters, digits, hyphens, underscores only (lowercase recommended)
# Examples: 94raunak, brian, kay
GPS_STATE_WRITER=''

# Note: After setting these values:
# 1. Restart the Streamlit app (Ctrl+C, then run again)
# 2. Check the sidebar - should show "Recording as [your name]"
# 3. Data will be stored in: GPS_STATE_DIR / GPS_STATE_WRITER /
